  "update_count": 71,
  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**\n\nChrome on Android compiles WebGPU shaders by first translating them to SPIR-V using tint, and then passing them for further compilation to libGLES_mali.so. The shader included in this bug report causes a SIGSEGV crash in libGLES_mali.so if the shader is compiled to SPIR-V"
